ed opponents","description":"Rhule and Nebraska brought an end to the Cornhuskers coach's infamous decade-long streak against Ohio State.","published":"2026-11-21T20:58:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50534102/nebraska-cornhuskers-matt-rhule-ranked-win-drought","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Syracuse QB Steve Angeli exits with injury, arm in sling","description":"Syracuse senior quarterback Steve Angeli left Saturday's game against Boston College with an injury to his throwing arm and will not return.","published":"2026-11-21T20:51:03.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552810/syracuse-qb-steve-angeli-exits-injury-arm-sling","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 12 live: Tracking top moments and best highlights","description":"Tracking the top plays and developments from Week 12.","published":"2026-11-21T18:35:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50541394/week-12-live-highlights","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Army pulls seating prank at Navy's football stadium ahead of Memphis game","description":"The letters were adjusted back in time for Navy's kickoff.","published":"2026-11-21T18:47:15.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50551457/army-navy-seat-prank","type":"Story","byline":"Associated Press","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Keisean Henderson leads Houston to win after QB Conner Weigman ruled out","description":"Houston ruled out starting QB Conner Weigman vs. West Virginia due to injury and instead went with true freshman Keisean Henderson, the No. 4 recruit for 2026.","published":"2026-11-21T21:38:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50550966/sources-houston-qb-conner-weigman-henderson-start","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-21T16:04:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-21T16:00:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan starts QB Bryce Underwood vs. UCLA; Andrew Marsh suspended","description":"Michigan started QB Bryce Underwood over Tommy Carr, who had started the past four games. WR Andrew Marsh, meanwhile, is suspended for Saturday's game vs. UCLA.","published":"2026-11-21T20:46:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50549879/sources-michigan-expected-start-bryce-underwood-vs-ucla","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4912358/tyrique-tucker","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tyrique_Tucker"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Tyrique Tucker","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tyrique_Tucker","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:22Z","intro":"Tyrique Tucker is an American college football defensive tackle for the Indiana Hoosiers. He previously played for the James Madison Dukes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Tucker attended Lake Taylor High School in Norfolk, Virginia for three years before transferring to Life Christian Academy in Colonial Heights, Virginia for his senior year. He committed to James Madison University (JMU) to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"After redshirting his first year at JMU in 2022, Tucker started five of 13 games and had 30 tackles and 1.5 sacks in 2023. After JMU's head coach, Curt Cignetti, was hired by the Indiana Hoosiers, Tucker entered the transfer portal and followed his coach to Indiana. In his first season at Indiana, he played in 13 games and had 24 tackles and 2.5 sacks. Tucker entered the 2025 season as a starter."}]}}